  targetNpc: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4831239f4401b4ca3bdcb64c115407e1, type: 2}
  body: "Between us... I'm completely gone on Suzy at the animals store. I freeze
    up every time she's near. Could you bring her five roses for me? Say they're
    from someone who thinks the world of her\u2014please don't use my name unless
    she asks."
  tip: Talk to james to start this quest.
